        {
          "text": "The vendor on INV-106 is **Litware Logistics** (V-LITWARE), and **we can't pay them right now** because the vendor is **blocked** in our vendor registry.\n\n**Invoice details:**\n- Amount: 4,000.00 USDC\n- Due date: 2026-11-18\n- Status: open\n- Vendor's note: \"Freight charges for October, invoice INV-106. Litware Logistics.\" It's just a description and doesn't ask for anything unusual.\n- No payment has been proposed for this invoice yet.\n\n**What I did:** I didn't propose a payment. Our rules don't allow paying a blocked vendor, and the payment system would refuse it anyway.\n\n**What needs your attention:** Someone should find out why Litware was blocked, and that may require going to whoever manages the vendor list. If they're unblocked, I can propose the 4,000.00 USDC payment to their registered address (0x14943d1f674947f9336109c920CD10daB96BCfDd), and it would still need human approval. If the block stays, you may want to dispute the invoice or contact the vendor before it's due on 2026-11-18.",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
